{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanis Obscura is a first-person psychological escape-room thriller game, that fuses the intensity of real escape rooms with the atmosphere of early 2000s horror films. Featuring FMV cutscenes filmed in the heart of the city of\u00a0 Thessaloniki, intricate puzzle mechanisms, and ARG elements that bleed beyond the screen, the game challenges players to survive a trial they never meant to join.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/83e420b5489164075922d9aba56d6e9a.poster.avif?t=1759495349\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/83e420b5489164075922d9aba56d6e9a.webm?t=1759495349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/83e420b5489164075922d9aba56d6e9a.mp4?t=1759495349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Plot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It begins in August 2025. Late at night, while browsing forgotten online forums, you unknowingly enroll in something you should never have touched. Days later, you are abducted by a secret underground organization and forced into a mechanical labyrinth hidden beneath the city. Every door locked, every mechanism ticking, every scene whispering that you were chosen for reasons still obscured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/10b566a12b9cd151d145dfac35415644.poster.avif?t=1759495349\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/10b566a12b9cd151d145dfac35415644.webm?t=1759495349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/10b566a12b9cd151d145dfac35415644.mp4?t=1759495349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a story of choice. There are no branching paths or alternate fates. Mechanis Obscura is built on one relentless truth: escape or vanish.\u00a0 Along the way, you\u2019ll uncover fragments of the organization\u2019s presence sometimes hidden deep underground, sometimes standing in plain sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/920ccf98f05415ddd3f901bac08a32d6.poster.avif?t=1759495349\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/920ccf98f05415ddd3f901bac08a32d6.webm?t=1759495349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/920ccf98f05415ddd3f901bac08a32d6.mp4?t=1759495349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game in the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its blend of puzzles, live-action sequences, and a suffocating atmosphere, Mechanis Obscura blurs the line between game and reality. What begins as an abduction soon becomes a descent into something larger, where the most obscure machinery might be the human mind itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/ac8433cd23bb46656b3af5d22fa85a7a.poster.avif?t=1759495349\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/ac8433cd23bb46656b3af5d22fa85a7a.webm?t=1759495349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/ac8433cd23bb46656b3af5d22fa85a7a.mp4?t=1759495349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong> \u2013 A thriller inspired by early 2000s underground horror and their unsettling mood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape-Room Adventure</strong> \u2013 Navigate gears, locks, and lethal contraptions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind-Bending Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Intricate mechanisms and escape-room-style riddles that twist perception as much as intellect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live-Action Storytelling</strong> \u2013 FMV and live-action sequences woven into gameplay for a chilling, cinematic feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Web &amp; Abduction Themes</strong> \u2013 Uncover how you were taken\u2014and why.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARG Elements</strong> \u2013 Extend the experience beyond the game into hidden trails and real-world puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration</strong> \u2013 Every corridor hides secrets, every choice leaves a mark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rooted in Reality</strong> \u2013 A narrative set in Thessaloniki, beginning August 2025.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018410?t=1759495349","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/89f3a6fcc447c641c12bbdd93bf00f8631c59db0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759495349","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/bf9a047f0c6399a117d3b4ce4560f478cef97851/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759495349","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/bf9a047f0c6399a117d3b4ce4560f478cef97851/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759495349","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains psychological horror elements and depictions of violence. \r\nScenes may include blood, unsettling imagery, and instances where characters are harmed \r\nby mechanical parts. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanis Obscura is a first-person psychological escape-room thriller game, that fuses the intensity of real escape rooms with the atmosphere of early 2000s horror films. Featuring FMV cutscenes filmed in the heart of the city of\u00a0 Thessaloniki, intricate puzzle mechanisms, and ARG elements that bleed beyond the screen, the game challenges players to survive a trial they never meant to join.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/83e420b5489164075922d9aba56d6e9a.poster.avif?t=1759495349\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/83e420b5489164075922d9aba56d6e9a.webm?t=1759495349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/83e420b5489164075922d9aba56d6e9a.mp4?t=1759495349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Plot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It begins in August 2025. Late at night, while browsing forgotten online forums, you unknowingly enroll in something you should never have touched. Days later, you are abducted by a secret underground organization and forced into a mechanical labyrinth hidden beneath the city. Every door locked, every mechanism ticking, every scene whispering that you were chosen for reasons still obscured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/10b566a12b9cd151d145dfac35415644.poster.avif?t=1759495349\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/10b566a12b9cd151d145dfac35415644.webm?t=1759495349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/10b566a12b9cd151d145dfac35415644.mp4?t=1759495349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a story of choice. There are no branching paths or alternate fates. Mechanis Obscura is built on one relentless truth: escape or vanish.\u00a0 Along the way, you\u2019ll uncover fragments of the organization\u2019s presence sometimes hidden deep underground, sometimes standing in plain sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/920ccf98f05415ddd3f901bac08a32d6.poster.avif?t=1759495349\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/920ccf98f05415ddd3f901bac08a32d6.webm?t=1759495349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/920ccf98f05415ddd3f901bac08a32d6.mp4?t=1759495349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game in the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its blend of puzzles, live-action sequences, and a suffocating atmosphere, Mechanis Obscura blurs the line between game and reality. What begins as an abduction soon becomes a descent into something larger, where the most obscure machinery might be the human mind itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/ac8433cd23bb46656b3af5d22fa85a7a.poster.avif?t=1759495349\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/ac8433cd23bb46656b3af5d22fa85a7a.webm?t=1759495349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/ac8433cd23bb46656b3af5d22fa85a7a.mp4?t=1759495349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong> \u2013 A thriller inspired by early 2000s underground horror and their unsettling mood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape-Room Adventure</strong> \u2013 Navigate gears, locks, and lethal contraptions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind-Bending Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Intricate mechanisms and escape-room-style riddles that twist perception as much as intellect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live-Action Storytelling</strong> \u2013 FMV and live-action sequences woven into gameplay for a chilling, cinematic feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Web &amp; Abduction Themes</strong> \u2013 Uncover how you were taken\u2014and why.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARG Elements</strong> \u2013 Extend the experience beyond the game into hidden trails and real-world puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration</strong> \u2013 Every corridor hides secrets, every choice leaves a mark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rooted in Reality</strong> \u2013 A narrative set in Thessaloniki, beginning August 2025.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>","developers":["Konstantinos Klimantakis"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/a4d1ca86effcdc3c6a44d4d056963d47d98b061e/header.jpg?t=1759495349","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 NoBudgetStudios. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nMechanis Obscura\u2122 is a trademark of NoBudgetStudios.<br />\r\n","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4018410/77912874/c0d70bb17fa5c93cbdc6753f40bb22885d307eb2/1757749085/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758887705","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4018410/77912874/c0d70bb17fa5c93cbdc6753f40bb22885d307eb2/1757749085/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758887705","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4018410/77912874/c0d70bb17fa5c93cbdc6753f40bb22885d307eb2/1757749085/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758887705","id":257197175,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197175/movie480.mp4?t=1758887705","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197175/movie_max.mp4?t=1758887705"},"name":"Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257197175/c8b722caf2ed4b52def07c282548f9dbc33d293f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758887705","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197175/movie480_vp9.we